{{Quote|A katana made out of regular steel, something a beginner samurai would pick.|Item}}
The '''Katana''' is a {{Common}} [[sword]].

The katana allows the user to cast basic dash and slash attacks.

==Obtainment==
The Katana can be purchased for {{Money|1,000}} from the [[Sword Dealer]].

